gs → Preview Settings), not in application code. It is complementary to the live preview SDK setup — the SDK handles real-time draft rendering while custom preview URLs define where the preview opens.", "contradictsStory": "No direct contradiction. However, the story's original estimate allocates 0 to BE and 0 to DAM with 8 for FE, implying this is primarily a front-end code task. The custom preview URLs document shows part of the work (preview URL configuration) is done in the Contentstack CMS UI, not in the application codebase — which may shift some effort outside the FE estimate." } ] }
